# Buttons

Every button shows a pointer cursor when hovered.

- Native `<button>` and `[role="button"]` already get this from `src/app/globals.css`. Do not set `cursor-default` or `cursor-auto` on them.
- A clickable control that is not a `<button>` (a link or other element styled as a button) gets `cursor-pointer`.
- Disabled buttons use `cursor-not-allowed`. Do not leave a disabled button on the default arrow cursor.
